WEBVTT

00:08.707 --> 00:11.417
<b>Angel's Playbox Entrance</b>

01:12.437 --> 01:14.517
<b>Monster: Toy Box</b>

01:17.547 --> 01:19.697
<i>The Fool's Acrobatics!</i>

01:27.587 --> 01:31.867
Doppellusion!

01:29.827 --> 01:31.867
<b>Doppellusion</b>

01:55.517 --> 01:57.057
<b>Shadow Stomp</b>

01:55.937 --> 01:57.057
<i>Shadow Stomp!</i>

02:03.897 --> 02:06.157
Dice Thrust!

02:20.827 --> 02:22.027
<i>Critical.</i>

02:35.137 --> 02:39.647
<i>I need to throw three more 
Magic Stones to beat it,</i>

02:39.647 --> 02:42.197
<i>and Dreamlords regenerate quickly.</i>

02:42.197 --> 02:44.387
<i>If I take too long, I'm screwed.</i>

02:50.067 --> 02:54.187
<i>No way. It shouldn't use Sylph Cutter 
with this positioning.</i>

02:54.867 --> 02:55.997
<b>Sylph Cutter</b>

02:59.257 --> 03:00.287
<i>It's no use.</i>

03:01.997 --> 03:03.327
<i>I can't avoid it.</i>

03:29.377 --> 03:31.677
<i>My consciousness is fading.</i>

03:34.157 --> 03:36.997
<i>My heart is racing.</i>

03:38.437 --> 03:41.197
<i>My legs feel weak.</i>

03:44.777 --> 03:47.027
<i>Status effect: Stunned.</i>

03:44.797 --> 03:47.677
<b>Status Effect
<b> Stunned</b></b>

03:47.967 --> 03:52.677
<i>I see. Well, a stun is fatal 
in this situation.</i>

03:53.707 --> 03:58.967
<i>Maybe my starting Luck value was low.</i>

04:01.607 --> 04:05.187
I should've asked Ruche to stay.

04:05.187 --> 04:07.187
Let's defeat it together.

04:17.737 --> 04:19.467
You called?

04:23.867 --> 04:26.477
Thanks for choosing me.

04:31.607 --> 04:33.217
Doppellusion!

04:35.677 --> 04:40.227
<b>Doppellusion</b>

04:43.087 --> 04:45.227
What are you doing?

04:45.577 --> 04:48.177
I thought you fled with those guys!

04:53.467 --> 04:57.847
I didn't sense you following us down 
what's basically a single path,

04:58.367 --> 05:04.077
so I took those two to a safe place 
and came back to check on you.

05:04.937 --> 05:10.877
You said you'd run right away, 
so why are you fighting them?!

05:10.877 --> 05:12.167
I...

05:13.637 --> 05:15.097
I'm being stubborn.

05:15.857 --> 05:18.387
You have to turn back, Ruche.

05:19.607 --> 05:21.057
In that case...

05:21.977 --> 05:25.307
I'll be stubborn with you.

05:32.497 --> 05:33.607
Don't pick that up.

05:33.897 --> 05:38.017
Pick up the coins you threw on the ground.

05:38.017 --> 05:39.617
Even a child can do that.

05:40.177 --> 05:44.307
You call this a gift when you threw it 
on the ground? Yeah, right.

05:45.207 --> 05:47.487
You saved me.

05:52.877 --> 05:56.387
You risked your life so I could escape.

05:57.757 --> 05:59.137
Take them and go.

05:59.567 --> 06:02.997
You said you needed my power.

06:03.437 --> 06:06.207
If abandoning someone like that

06:07.847 --> 06:10.437
and running away were something I'd do,

06:11.787 --> 06:14.697
I would've quit adventuring 
a long time ago!

06:25.167 --> 06:30.207
But the only effective attack 
I had won't work anymore.

06:30.537 --> 06:34.717
Neither of us has the long-range 
skills needed to reach it.

06:34.717 --> 06:37.467
So you're giving up?!

06:38.477 --> 06:45.297
You relied on me when 
I called myself useless.

06:45.937 --> 06:47.187
It's fine.

06:48.467 --> 06:49.687
Ruche...

06:53.057 --> 06:56.697
Ruche, I need you.

07:01.217 --> 07:04.197
Let me help you again.

07:20.307 --> 07:21.957
Doppellusion...

07:23.097 --> 07:24.607
<i>I see now.</i>

07:25.967 --> 07:29.017
<i>Far more than I imagined, Ruche is...</i>

07:31.157 --> 07:32.467
Help me, Ruche.

07:35.907 --> 07:37.967
I need your power.

07:49.827 --> 07:52.347
Let's beat the Embryo together!

07:52.347 --> 07:55.027
Yeah! Let's do it, Mr. Elymas!

08:32.417 --> 08:33.667
<b>Loading</b>

08:44.927 --> 08:46.227
<b>Loading</b>

08:57.567 --> 08:58.857
<b>Loading</b>

09:07.117 --> 09:07.867
<b>Loading</b>

09:09.367 --> 09:14.957
<b>Begin Adventure</b>

09:09.377 --> 09:14.957
<b>Begin Adventure</b>

09:26.097 --> 09:31.017
<b>Episode 9</b>

09:26.097 --> 09:31.017
<b>Dreamlord</b>

09:35.977 --> 09:37.527
They're coming, Mr. Elymas!

09:40.487 --> 09:42.047
Shield Bash!

09:44.937 --> 09:45.947
Ruche!

09:55.327 --> 09:57.997
I've got this. I can do this.

10:03.087 --> 10:04.717
<b>Repair</b>

10:18.237 --> 10:20.427
This'll never end.

10:22.607 --> 10:26.127
Yeah. It's pointless 
to defeat the Tin Knights.

10:26.127 --> 10:29.337
We can't win a drawn-out fight.

10:30.207 --> 10:32.747
We have to defeat the Embryo itself.

10:34.737 --> 10:36.647
Do you have a strategy?

10:37.737 --> 10:39.017
Technically, yes.

10:40.127 --> 10:43.297
Hit it with your Dice Thrust.

10:44.607 --> 10:47.297
If you miss, it's over.

10:47.297 --> 10:51.287
It's a one in six chance 
that comes down to your luck.

10:52.947 --> 10:58.487
The Embryo's fleshy armor has 
88 Defense when its eye is closed.

10:58.517 --> 11:00.437
<b>Defense: 88</b>

11:00.437 --> 11:05.707
Your Dice Thrust crits pierced 
the 200 Defense of the Golden Raana.

11:03.937 --> 11:06.197
<b>Defense: 200</b>

11:06.597 --> 11:09.687
Through brute force, 
you can deal massive damage.

11:11.417 --> 11:16.207
We should be able to defeat the Embryo 
without using the standard strategy.

11:16.207 --> 11:20.327
But how am I supposed to 
reach it up there?

11:35.207 --> 11:36.847
Acrobatic Amble!

11:37.167 --> 11:41.377
No, you'd be making yourself 
the perfect target for its Sylph Cutter.

11:41.377 --> 11:43.117
Then what do we do?

11:43.117 --> 11:45.007
I'll close the gap.

11:45.357 --> 11:46.377
What?

11:47.807 --> 11:49.947
Be ready to follow up.

11:51.647 --> 11:57.457
If it works, I'll use Shield Bash 
to send you flying.

11:58.237 --> 12:00.427
It's risky, though.

12:02.217 --> 12:05.927
If we fail, we could both die.

12:16.097 --> 12:20.637
So I have to roll a six on Dice Thrust.

12:21.097 --> 12:24.607
If that's our only option, 
then we have to try.

12:24.917 --> 12:29.357
I'll do it. I promise I'll roll a six.

12:30.057 --> 12:31.837
I'm counting on you, Ruche.

12:31.837 --> 12:34.327
Good luck.

12:37.147 --> 12:37.897
Got it.

12:43.127 --> 12:44.157
Vital Slice!

12:44.157 --> 12:45.807
Now, Ruche! Jump!

12:49.217 --> 12:51.367
<i>Shield Bash!</i>

12:53.067 --> 12:54.827
<i>So far, so good.</i>

12:55.487 --> 12:58.727
<i>Now we pray to the goddess of luck.</i>

12:58.727 --> 13:01.417
<i>Against the second Golden Raana,</i>

12:58.727 --> 13:06.727
<i>Miss.</i>

13:01.417 --> 13:05.507
<i>the lucky Ruche failed to roll 
a six seven times in a row.</i>

13:07.037 --> 13:11.227
<i>I know that streak doesn't 
mean anything, but...</i>

13:12.357 --> 13:14.397
<i>probability converges.</i>

13:14.867 --> 13:18.077
<i>Dice Thrust!</i>

13:16.327 --> 13:18.077
<i>We'll only get one chance.</i>

13:19.507 --> 13:20.707
<i>Please!</i>

13:30.697 --> 13:31.547
<i>Miss.</i>

13:44.357 --> 13:47.937
<i>Dice Thrust!</i>

13:45.967 --> 13:47.937
<i>We'll only get one chance.</i>

13:48.777 --> 13:49.907
<i>Please!</i>

13:59.027 --> 14:00.077
<i>Miss.</i>

14:08.547 --> 14:10.087
<i>We failed.</i>

14:11.127 --> 14:13.757
<i>That may have been the only way,</i>

14:14.077 --> 14:18.337
<i>but we still shouldn't have 
gambled with our lives.</i>

14:19.567 --> 14:24.267
<i>How can we survive this?</i>

14:29.617 --> 14:31.987
<i>I can't give up now.</i>

14:34.987 --> 14:40.077
<i>I should at least tank the Tin Knights 
so Ruche can land safely.</i>

14:50.137 --> 14:53.007
<i>Acrobatic Amble!</i>

14:59.547 --> 15:00.757
Here it comes!

15:02.207 --> 15:10.567
My actual final Dice Thrust!

15:43.807 --> 15:47.317
<i>2,117 EXP acquired.</i>

15:43.807 --> 15:50.017
<b>2,117 EXP acquired</b>

15:47.317 --> 15:50.017
<i>Level 39 reached.</i>

15:50.407 --> 15:54.027
<i>I made one big mistake.</i>

15:54.317 --> 15:56.977
<i>Level 41 reached.</i>

15:59.037 --> 16:03.647
<i>All I could do was pray 
Ruche would get lucky.</i>

16:05.587 --> 16:11.577
<i>But Ruche seized victory 
even after luck forsake her.</i>

16:15.107 --> 16:18.647
D-Did I really defeat it?

16:22.707 --> 16:23.807
Ruche.

16:24.817 --> 16:27.747
I would've died without you.

16:27.747 --> 16:29.307
Thank you.

16:36.777 --> 16:38.237
Aw, really?

16:38.237 --> 16:43.257
I think exploring this dungeon 
really boosted my confidence.

16:43.827 --> 16:51.327
People have always called my class 
useless, but we found a ton of items.

16:51.327 --> 16:52.827
Even Dice Thrust was—

16:52.827 --> 16:55.087
That's not what I meant.

16:55.347 --> 16:56.377
Huh?

16:58.457 --> 17:00.057
Thanks for being you.

17:05.237 --> 17:07.397
Cline really screwed up.

17:10.207 --> 17:14.437
<i>I'd only been judging people 
by their classes and levels, too.</i>

17:15.617 --> 17:19.607
<i>In that regard, I'm no different 
from my father or Cline.</i>

17:19.607 --> 17:22.607
<i>I was just applying different standards.</i>

17:26.117 --> 17:31.367
<i>Ruche risked her life to come back 
and save me when I was being stubborn.</i>

17:32.667 --> 17:37.417
<i>On top of that, her quick thinking 
turned a desperate situation around,</i>

17:37.417 --> 17:39.367
<i>and she defeated the Embryo.</i>

17:43.937 --> 17:49.867
<i>Grateful and dutiful, she performs 
beyond her limits when it counts.</i>

17:53.887 --> 17:57.067
No one's more dependable than you.

17:57.067 --> 17:59.787
I'm not that great.

18:00.527 --> 18:04.817
<b>"The Upsetter" title acquired</b>

18:00.907 --> 18:04.037
Oh, please, Mr. Elymas.

18:06.857 --> 18:09.807
<i>"The Upsetter" title acquired.</i>

18:07.527 --> 18:11.077
<b>"The Upsetter" title acquired</b>

18:09.807 --> 18:12.687
<i>Defeat a Dreamlord with a party 
of two members or less at a level</i>

18:12.687 --> 18:15.287
<i>70% or lower than the recommended level.</i>

18:13.037 --> 18:15.287
Don't tease me like that.

18:15.287 --> 18:18.957
<b>"The Upsetter" title acquired</b>

18:15.287 --> 18:22.797
<b>Defeat a Dreamlord with a party of two 
members or less at a level 70% or lower
 than the recommended level</b>

18:15.287 --> 18:22.797
<b>Attack and Speed increase by 
15% when fighting higher-level enemies</b>

18:15.807 --> 18:22.797
<i>Attack and Speed increase by 15% 
when fighting higher-level enemies.</i>

18:27.187 --> 18:31.057
<i>This title is acquired by defeating 
Dreamlords at low level.</i>

18:32.217 --> 18:37.357
<i>I was planning to get it eventually 
since it was essential in </i>Magic World,<i></i>

18:37.807 --> 18:41.257
<i>but I never thought I'd get it so soon.</i>

18:43.117 --> 18:45.317
They dropped some items.

18:45.317 --> 18:47.237
Tin Swords! Hooray!

18:47.237 --> 18:49.327
What? Really?

18:49.327 --> 18:51.907
<i>Tin Sword. Level 35.</i>

18:51.907 --> 18:54.007
<i>Attack: +9.</i>

18:54.327 --> 18:56.977
<i>Market price: 2,400,000 gold.</i>

18:56.077 --> 18:58.327
<b>Tin Sword
 Attack: +9
 Market Price: 2,400,000G
 A Tin Knight's sword</b>

18:56.977 --> 18:58.327
<i>A Tin Knight's sword.</i>

18:58.327 --> 19:02.257
<i>She makes it rain valuable items.</i>

19:02.257 --> 19:06.257
<i>The benefits of the Lady Luck 
skill tree are huge.</i>

19:07.097 --> 19:12.217
<i>But it takes courage to walk around 
with those equipped.</i>

19:14.167 --> 19:17.977
<i>This makes me hope the Embryo 
dropped something good, too.</i>

19:18.577 --> 19:20.037
Ruche.

19:20.037 --> 19:23.477
Did they drop a bow with 
a wind-type enchantment skill?

19:23.477 --> 19:25.927
A bow? I'm not sure.

19:25.927 --> 19:27.647
It's one of the Embryo's drops.

19:28.537 --> 19:31.487
<i>I can't expect things to go that well.</i>

19:36.107 --> 19:37.627
A skill book!

19:38.747 --> 19:42.877
<i>Those are way rarer than weapons.</i>

19:41.837 --> 19:47.217
<b>Intermediate Wind Magic Skill Book
 Market Price: 20,000,000G
 Unlocks Intermediate Wind Magic skill tree, granting access to
 slicing single-target attacks, thundering area of effect attacks,
 and tailwinds to boost movement speed</b>

19:45.927 --> 19:49.817
<i>And it's for the really handy 
Intermediate Wind Magic skill tree.</i>

19:52.097 --> 19:55.067
<i>Skill Books are naturally expensive,</i>

19:56.397 --> 20:00.597
<i>but their value has shot up here 
thanks to nobles hoarding them.</i>

20:01.577 --> 20:03.647
<i>This should be unbelievably valuable.</i>

20:04.227 --> 20:06.207
What is it, Mr. Elymas?

20:06.207 --> 20:08.627
Why are you hiding that item?

20:08.627 --> 20:09.987
Sorry.

20:10.797 --> 20:12.687
We found something crazy.

20:12.687 --> 20:14.987
This'll really make us a target.

20:15.307 --> 20:19.497
<i>We'll have to sell this to that old woman.</i>

20:35.397 --> 20:37.847
Mr. Elymas, what's happening?

20:37.847 --> 20:39.267
Don't worry.

20:39.267 --> 20:42.857
The dungeon is just disappearing 
since the Dreamlord was defeated.

20:43.527 --> 20:45.647
We'll be outside before you know it.

20:45.647 --> 20:47.417
Really?

20:47.857 --> 20:49.737
That scared me.

20:49.737 --> 20:52.117
This is all so new to me.

20:56.697 --> 20:58.617
Maybe I should wait to say this...

20:58.617 --> 20:59.617
What is it?

21:00.127 --> 21:03.627
But we made over 60 million gold.

21:04.187 --> 21:05.787
Huh? What?

21:06.297 --> 21:11.627
m 0 0 l 225 0 225 65 0 65)

21:06.297 --> 21:11.627
<b>Skill Book: 20,000,000G</b>

21:06.337 --> 21:11.627
<b>Total: 63,840,000G</b>

21:06.447 --> 21:09.517
That's just a rough estimate, though.

21:06.457 --> 21:11.627
<b>Dazzling Raana Decorative Blade: 17,000,000G x2</b>

21:06.627 --> 21:11.627
<b>Tin Sword: 2,400,000G x2</b>

21:06.837 --> 21:11.627
<b>Bear Shield: 200,000G x2</b>

21:07.047 --> 21:11.627
<b>Embryo Magic Stone: 1,300,000G</b>

21:07.207 --> 21:11.627
<b>Tin Knight Magic Stone: 600,000G x3</b>

21:07.377 --> 21:11.627
<b>Golden Raana Magic Stone: 600,000G x2</b>

21:07.587 --> 21:11.627
<b><u>Patchwork Bear Magic Stone: 170,000G x2</u></b>

21:16.777 --> 21:18.387
Ruche, are you okay?

21:19.017 --> 21:20.377
Ruche, what's wrong?

21:20.777 --> 21:23.897
You really should've waited.

21:55.927 --> 21:59.427
<b>Translator:
Sho Stifler

Timer:
Krzysztof Kunc

Editor:
Salem Alabanza

Quality Control:
Gabriella Alabanza

Final Quality Control:
Sriram Gurunathan</b>

23:10.587 --> 23:14.177
<i>We defeated the Embryo thanks to Ruche.</i>

23:14.177 --> 23:16.117
<i>She's an incredible ally.</i>

23:16.577 --> 23:18.347
<i>She's brought me closer</i>

23:18.347 --> 23:22.017
<i>to achieving my true goal of acquiring 
a Fang of Smoldering Insanity Skill Book.</i>

23:22.017 --> 23:26.597
<i>Just a little more, 
and I'll have 50 million gold.</i>

23:27.087 --> 23:33.227
<i>But I doubt that greedy 
old woman will make it easy.</i>

23:33.517 --> 23:35.147
<i>Next time, "Negotiation."</i>

23:35.657 --> 23:39.387
<i>First, let's celebrate 
beating the dungeon.</i>
